<h1><%= @monitor.name %> is down</h1>

<p>
  <% if @monitor.is_a? Monitor::Fetch %>
    We didn't get successfull resposne when fetching your website with url: <%= @monitor.url %>
  <% else %>
    We haven't received any heartbeats from your website in over <%= @monitor.time_considered_active %> seconds.
  <% end %>
</p>

<p>
  If this website countinues to be down we won't send you emails so not to spam. <br/>
  However we will send mail when website is up again <br/>
  A detailed report is attached. <br/>
</p>
